    "name": {
      "value": "Monk"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "crb"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Monastic training has taught you martial arts and allowed you to hone your mind, body, and spirit to new heights.\n\n**Multiclass Monk characters:**\nThe monk archetype is a strong choice for any character that fights unarmored or with unarmed attacks.\n\n- Barbarian monks with the animal instinct can combine the barbarian's excellent unarmed damage with the monk's diverse unarmed special abilities.\n- Champion monks are perfect for champions of Irori or other deities who favor unarmed attacks.\n- Fighter monks can supplement free-hand fighting and add mobility to the fighter's toolkit.\n- Rogue monks are incredibly effective because stances grant some of the best agile finesse attacks and flurry gives more sneak attacks.\n- Spellcaster monks can fight with a free hand and still use material components to cast spells."
    },
